    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shopkeeper Simulator VR is the only trading game for VR in which you have to run a grocery store for the long term. Earn money with food, reorder it, and unlock helpful equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different, delicious foods: From broccoli to meat to cheese!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gear for better efficiency: Store products in your fridge to keep them fresh; get notified of new customers by a doorbell and store your bundles of money in the money safe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dollhouse mode for smaller players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wicked sound effects! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shopkeeper Simulator VR is the only trading game for VR in which you have to run a grocery store for the long term. Earn money with food, reorder it, and unlock helpful equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many different, delicious foods: From broccoli to meat to cheese!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock gear for better efficiency: Store products in your fridge to keep them fresh; get notified of new customers by a doorbell and store your bundles of money in the money safe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dollhouse mode for smaller players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wicked sound effects! </p></li></ul>",
